[41.8835, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m\u25b8 grok\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.9749, "o", "  Synopsis \u2014 already on the log, no need to re-debug:\r\n"]
[43.2023, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.3387, "o", "    Free shipping is wrong because we compare the tax-inclusive total\r\n"]
[43.5661, "o", "    to the $500 threshold. A $480 cart + tax looks like $518, so it\r\n"]
[43.7935, "o", "    ships free even though marketing means $500 of merchandise.\r\n"]
[44.0208, "o", "\r\n"]
[44.1573, "o", "    Codex verified that (hyp 5fbd68af). Investigation only \u2014 don't fix yet.\r\n"]
[44.3847, "o", "    I didn't re-run the tests; the casefile already has the answer.\r\n"]
